  "body": "Given [`dataTransfer`](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/dnd.html#the-datatransfer-interface) is used for both drag & drop and for [copy & paste](https://w3c.github.io/clipboard-apis/), it's strange to call its access policy [drag data store mode](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/dnd.html#drag-data-store-mode). It's probably better called as \"data transfer access policy\" or some other name which doesn't mention dragging.",
